The lag-by-mechanism grid: reporting lag $\ell$ and effective delay $k=\ell+1$ are shown side by side because the theory's $g^\star(k)$ refers to $k$. Twenty seeds per cell. Generated by scripts/paper_tables.py from results/B2. Source: reference_results/ (the Lead's independent reference run; cross-checked against the experiment layer in reference_results/CROSSCHECK.md).
